1
00:00:00,729 --> 00:00:02,659
(Amy:)Oh. Okay.

2
00:00:07,136 --> 00:00:09,906
(Bernadette:)Wipe that smug smile
off your face.

3
00:00:09,972 --> 00:00:12,842
(Howard:)Maybe I'm happy
that so many people turned up

4
00:00:12,908 --> 00:00:15,108
(Howard:)to help the less fortunate.

5
00:00:15,177 --> 00:00:16,447
(chuckles)

6
00:00:16,512 --> 00:00:18,442
(Emily:)Are you and I close
enough for me to say...

7
00:00:18,514 --> 00:00:20,384
(Bernadette:)That he's an ass?
He beat you to it.

8
00:00:21,683 --> 00:00:23,683
(Soup Kitchen Manager:)I was wrong.
A large group had to cancel.

9
00:00:23,752 --> 00:00:25,922
(Bernadette:)Oh, great.
We'd love to help.

10
00:00:27,589 --> 00:00:29,959
(Bernadette:)Wipe that smug smile
off your face.

11
00:00:30,759 --> 00:00:34,329
(laughing):
I can't!

12
00:00:35,631 --> 00:00:36,661
Look at us!

13
00:00:36,732 --> 00:00:38,762
(Penny:)Our first Thanksgiving
as husband and wife.

14
00:00:38,834 --> 00:00:39,934
(Leonard:)I know.

15
00:00:40,002 --> 00:00:41,102
(Leonard:)I feel so grown up.

16
00:00:41,170 --> 00:00:43,440
Sweetie, you are grown up.
Really?

17
00:00:43,505 --> 00:00:47,505
(Leonard:)How many grown-ups do you know
who have Mr. Spock oven mitts?

18
00:00:47,576 --> 00:00:49,746
(Leonard:)Hey, the recipes
are on my iPad.

19
00:00:49,812 --> 00:00:51,512
(Leonard:)Will you pull 'em up?
Yep.

20
00:00:51,580 --> 00:00:54,520
(Penny:)What's the code?
My birthday.

21
00:00:54,583 --> 00:00:56,213
(Penny:)It's not working.

22
00:00:56,285 --> 00:01:00,025
(Leonard:)It's just the four digits...
month and day.

